'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It's no longer obtainable through trading, as the event has since concluded. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is dark gray with a white, orange, and yellow edge that resembles the appearance of a piece of candy corn, hence the name. The guard uses the same texture as the edge, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Candy Corn Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

